<p>  Commodity		Tons		Ship/Name	 Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Cement	     3,672 (LDD) 3,578   Ocean Crest	 14/03</p>
<p> Wheat		5,569 (ULD)28,556   M V Harikishin    13/03</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  2,393 (LDD) 2,607   M V Bu Hung	 14/03</p>
<p> LPG		    986 (ULD)   839   M V Virgo Gas     14/03</p>
